# Conformance probe pack for an outer transform-decode followed by an inner
# no-kind (spec 0.34, Decode: an error that stops the decode is reported
# ahead of a transform-decode read before it), most significant bit first.
# Public.
#
#   byte 0      s1, one ascii character
#   the rest    one conformance-inner-seq message
format     conformance-inner-askind
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.s1  8  ascii
inner   conformance-inner-seq
